nrole lane : between gap /2, space above gap\nrole lanename : text down medium tracked, soft\nrole lanecards : between gap /2\nrole taskcard : on wash, edge faint, corner gap, pad gap /2, pad left gap, pad right gap\nrole taskcard.live : on wash, edge accent, corner gap, pad gap /2, pad left gap, pad right gap\nrole cardtitle : text down medium, ink\nrole cardline : between gap\nrole cardwho : text down, soft\nrole cardlane : text down 2, soft\nrole still : faint\nrole cardopen : text down 2, soft\nrole cardmore : between gap /2, pad top gap /2, pad bottom gap /2, space above gap /2, border top rim\nrole cardnote : between gap /4, pad left gap, border left rim\nrole cardtext : text down, soft\nrole cut : text down, soft\n# a5398: the home base's viewer (home-viewer, home-note, home-chat, home-surface)\nrole viewer : between gap\nrole findbar : between gap, on glass, edge rim, corner gap x2, pad gap /2, pad left gap\nrole find : text, ink, on wash, corner gap x1.5, pad gap\nrole pins : between gap /2\nrole found : on glassdeep, edge rim, corner gap x2, pad gap x1.5, between gap /2\nrole foundlist : between gap /4\nrole hit : between gap, pad gap /2, corner gap\nrole shown : on glassdeep, edge rim, corner gap x2, pad gap x2, between gap\nrole viewhead : between gap, pad bottom gap, border bottom rim\nrole viewlanes : between gap\nrole viewlane : on wash, corner gap x1.5, pad gap, between gap\nrole viewlanehead : text down medium, soft\nrole viewlanelist : between gap /2\nrole viewcard : on glass, edge rim, corner gap, pad gap, between gap /4\nrole viewcard.p1 : on glass, edge warm, corner gap, pad gap, between gap /4\nrole viewcardtitle : text down, ink\nrole docheading : text up medium, ink, space above gap\n# a5504: the waiting list opens in place (waiting-on-me), and a demo opened inside a card wears this style: report..composer are the demo lens's own role names\nrole count : text.label medium, night, on warm, corner gap x2, pad left gap /1.5, pad right gap /1.5\nrole tag : text.label tracked, faint\nrole tag.demo : text.label medium tracked, warm\nrole tag.design : text.label medium tracked, warm\nrole waithit : between gap /4\nrole reviewbody : between gap, pad top gap, border top rim\nrole demo : on night, edge rim, corner gap, pad gap, height gap x60\nrole report : on wash, ink, text, pad gap x1.5, edge rim, corner gap x1.5\nrole eyebrow : text.mono tracked, soft, space below gap\nrole title : text up strong, ink\nrole subtitle : text down, soft, space below gap\nrole check : on wash, pad gap, corner gap, space below gap\nrole label : text medium, ink\nrole good : text.mono strong, ink, pad left gap\nrole detail : text down, soft, space above gap /2\nrole boundary : text down 2, soft, space above gap\nrole message : pad gap /2, space below gap\nrole author : text down medium, soft\nrole composer : text, ink, on wash, corner gap, pad gap\n# a5500: the dock along the foot of the home base (home-dock)\nrole appfoot : pad top gap x2\nrole appdock : on glassdeep, edge rim, corner gap x2, pad gap, pad left gap x2, pad right gap x2\nrole appshelf : between gap x1.5\nrole appicons : between gap\nrole appslot : between gap /4\nrole appicon : on wash, edge faint, corner gap x1.5, pad gap, width gap x11, between gap /4\nrole appicon.on : on mine, edge ink, corner gap x1.5, pad gap, width gap x11, between gap /4\nrole appadd : on glass, edge rim, soft, corner gap x1.5, pad gap, width gap x11, between gap /4\nrole appglyph : text up 3, ink, align center\nrole applabel : text down 2, soft, align center\n# a5504: the board (home-board): one colour per lane, used only as small marks (a dot, a rail, a count); a card is a raised tile; a card whose worker is at work has an edge in its lane colour (a5816, Alex 16 Oct: no breathing, no glide, no pulse, wave or hover lift anywhere in this style; only the pomodoro ring moves)\ntoken shadow = #000000\ntoken sky = #8E97A4\ntoken teal = #8E97A4\ntoken raised = #E7EBF009\ntoken raisedhi = #E7EBF012\ntoken skywash = #8E97A41A\ntoken jeffwash2 = #B9A8FF1A\ntoken accentwash = #63E2C014\ntoken warmwash = #FFB54719\ntoken tealwash = #8E97A41A\nrole bdhead : between gap, pad bottom gap /2\nrole bdlivecount : text.label medium, accent\nrole bdlane : between gap /2, space above gap x1.5\nrole bdlanehead : between gap, pad left gap /4\nrole bddot : text down, faint\nrole bddot.asked : text down, faint\nrole bddot.working : text down, accent\nrole bddot.ready : text down, soft\nrole bddot.landing : text down, soft\nrole bdlanename : text.label medium tracked, soft\nrole bdcount : text.label medium, faint, on wash, corner gap x2, pad left gap /2, pad right gap /2\nrole bdcount.asked : text.label medium, soft, on wash, corner gap x2, pad left gap /2, pad right gap /2\nrole bdcount.working : text.label medium, accent, on accentwash, corner gap x2, pad left gap /2, pad right gap /2\nrole bdcount.ready : text.label medium, soft, on wash, corner gap x2, pad left gap /2, pad right gap /2\nrole bdcount.landing : text.label medium, soft, on wash, corner gap x2, pad left gap /2, pad right gap /2\nrole bdcards : between gap /2\nrole bdcard : on raised, corner gap, pad gap /2, pad left gap x1.5, pad right gap\nrole bdcard.asked : on raised, rail ghost, corner gap, pad gap /2, pad left gap x1.5, pad right gap\nrole bdcard.working : on raised, rail faint, corner gap, pad gap /2, pad left gap x1.5, pad right gap\nrole bdcard.live : on raisedhi, rail accent, corner gap, pad gap /2, pad left gap x1.5, pad right gap\nrole bdcard.asking : on jeffwash, rail jeff, corner gap, pad gap /2, pad left gap x1.5, pad right gap\nrole bdcard.ready : on raised, rail soft, corner gap, pad gap /2, pad left gap x1.5, pad right gap\nrole bdcard.landing : on raisedhi, rail soft, edge rim, corner gap, pad gap /2, pad left gap x1.5, pad right gap\nrole bdcard.landed : corner gap, pad gap /4, pad left gap x1.5, pad right gap\nrole bdline : between gap\nrole bdtitle : text down medium, ink\nrole bdtitle.landed : text down, faint\nrole bdwho : text.label, faint\nrole bdstate : text.label medium, accent\nrole bdstate.asking : text.label medium, jeff\nrole bdmore : between gap /2, pad top gap /2, pad bottom gap /2, space above gap /2, border top rim\n# a5592: the music panel (home-music)\nrole musictop : between gap\nrole mediakey : text up 2, ink, on wash, corner gap x3, pad gap /2, pad left gap, pad right gap\nrole nowplaying : between gap /4\n# a5496: the home base's layout (home-tiling, home-panels, the *-small one-line views)\nrole stage : between gap x2\nrole top : between gap x2\nrole clock : between gap\nrole clocktime : text up 3 strong, ink\nrole clockday : text down, soft\nrole tiling : between gap x2\nrole pinned : between gap\nrole tilecol : between gap x2\nrole tilefoot : height gap x6\nrole pane : on glass, edge rim, corner gap x2, pad gap x2, between gap x1.5\nrole pane.big : on glassdeep, edge rim, corner gap x2, pad gap x2, between gap x1.5\nrole panehead : between gap\nrole panetitle : text.label medium tracked, soft\nrole panesum : text down, soft\nrole panebody : between gap\nrole summary : text down, soft\nrole shelf : between gap /2\nrole dockchip : soft, edge rim, corner gap, pad gap /2, pad left gap, pad right gap\nrole dockchip.on : ink, on wash, edge ink, corner gap, pad gap /2, pad left gap, pad right gap\nrole chipname : text down medium\nrole chipsum : text down 2, soft\n# a5530: the widgets in the home base's top bar (home-widgets): clock, now, pomodoro, notices\nrole widgets : between gap x4, align center\nrole widget : align center\nrole widget.wide : align center\nrole wclock : between gap\nrole wtime : text up 3 medium, ink\nrole wdate : text down, soft\nrole nowbar : between gap\nrole nowline : between gap, on wash, corner gap x2, pad gap /2, pad left gap x1.5, pad right gap x1.5\nrole nowlabel : text down 2 medium tracked, soft\nrole nowtext : text down, ink, width 22em\nrole pomo : between gap\nrole pomotimer : between gap, align cen